'''Mianloong Chamber''' is an area of [[Mt. Firmament]], [[Huanglong]]. It is the hibernation capsule that descended to [[Jinzhou]] with the Sentinel [[Jué]]. It marks the end of pilgrimage and the gateway to Jinzhou's true future.

