{{NPCs by Location List|Mianloong Chamber}}

==Trivia==
* In {{Quest|The Star That Voyages Far}}, it's revealed that the vessel that carried Sentinel Jué was transported by an [[Exostrider]] from [[Homeland Civilization]] to [[Solaris-3]].<ref>{{Quest|The Star That Voyages Far}}
:'''''Aemeath:''' That was when I realized that Exostriders were built to transport Sentinels.''
:'''''Aemeath:''' They trekked through stars to deliver Sentinels to Solaris.''</ref>

